  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Adore (Prince)** (1 other source): Gener performs the Prince song Adore solo [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Squelch the Little Weasel**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Up On A Hill**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Gladiola Heartbreaker**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Weed Whore**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Can You Taste the Waste?**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Adore (Prince)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Stacie**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Birthday Boy, Boing, She Fucks Me [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1990-12-14** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 67 min [1]. Said about its sound: The uploader says the fidelity is pretty bad [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1990-12-14**: Ripped and posted in June 2013 by robert collins (the wizard) at Escape is Terminal; n00q later uploaded it to Archive in 2023 [1]",
